        "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u>Endless freak hordes want your property.</u></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u>Your own army wants a paycheck.</u></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3928560/extras/5a7539c0c6a0c8d6f1d9b27bee7c0d61.poster.avif?t=1769489754\" width=768 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3928560/extras/5a7539c0c6a0c8d6f1d9b27bee7c0d61.webm?t=1769489754\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3928560/extras/5a7539c0c6a0c8d6f1d9b27bee7c0d61.mp4?t=1769489754\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The battlefield produces resources.Enemy bodies produce souls.Friendly bodies do too.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect everything. Feed it into your economy. Power demon summoning towers, reinforce defenses, and keep the system running at all costs. Loyalty is temporary. Souls are forever.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3928560/extras/628a34ff808f13a2e08d4c5642908a88.poster.avif?t=1769489754\" width=768 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3928560/extras/628a34ff808f13a2e08d4c5642908a88.webm?t=1769489754\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3928560/extras/628a34ff808f13a2e08d4c5642908a88.mp4?t=1769489754\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your defenses are not fire-and-forget. Towers consume resources continuously, upgrades raise maintenance costs, and growth only makes the system more fragile.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Spend too little, and the line breaks.Spend too much, and the economy collapses.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When the numbers stop working, everything else follows.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3928560/extras/f69ab3728134696e7fbae5ffeaf6c11e.poster.avif?t=1769489754\" width=768 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3928560/extras/f69ab3728134696e7fbae5ffeaf6c11e.webm?t=1769489754\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3928560/extras/f69ab3728134696e7fbae5ffeaf6c11e.mp4?t=1769489754\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each run presents new card-based choices that reshape your strategy. Stack absurd synergies, break the rules, or accidentally build an economy that eats itself alive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some builds dominate.Some builds implode.All of them are temporary.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3928560/extras/1665cea9a3a377f5a44ebca52b9e709d.poster.avif?t=1769489754\" width=768 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3928560/extras/1665cea9a3a377f5a44ebca52b9e709d.webm?t=1769489754\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3928560/extras/1665cea9a3a377f5a44ebca52b9e709d.mp4?t=1769489754\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The freak hordes keep coming.Your income fluctuates.Your army keeps dying.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survive long enough to grow powerful—but not so long that the system becomes impossible to sustain.</p>",
